  {
   "id": "ev2603DE_007",
   "idx": [
    7
   ],
   "jp": "{8000}{860A}{949F}「どうやら{8207}言うだけムダだったようだな」{8300}{861A}{949F}「今度こそ、ここでくたばるがいい！！」{8300}{861A}{949F}「いでよ！{8207}{8833}クスーフェ{8800}！！{8855}ヴァイア{8800}！！」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8000}{860A}{949F}It seems talking to you was a waste of breath.{8300}{861A}{949F}This time, you will perish here for good!!{8300}{861A}{949F}Come forth! {8833}Kusufe{8800}!! {8855}Vaia{8800}!!{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
