   "idx": [
    8
   ],
   "jp": "{8000}{861A}{949F}「まったく・・・しぶといヤツだ・・・！」{8300}{860A}{949F}「だが、いくら戦っても{8207}ムダだと言うことは知っているだろう？」{8300}{860A}{949F}「今一度このおろか者と戦うのだ！{8207}{8833}クスーフェ{8800}！！{8855}ヴァイア{8800}！！」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8000}{861A}{949F}Honestly... what a stubborn one...!{8300}{860A}{949F}But surely you know by now that no matter how much you fight, it is useless?{8300}{860A}{949F}Fight this fool once more! {8833}Kusufe{8800}!! {8855}Vaia{8800}!!{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
